@baseUrl = http://localhost:5234
@productId = 1

### Listar productos
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/api/products

### Buscar por nombre (contiene, sin distinguir mayusculas)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/api/products?search=notebook

### Obtener producto por id
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/api/products/{{productId}}

### Crear producto (201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Notebook ASUS Zenbook 14 OLED",
  "description": "Intel Core Ultra 7, 16 GB RAM, SSD 1 TB, pantalla OLED 14\"",
  "price": 1349.00,
  "stock": 5
}

### Crear con nombre duplicado (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "mouse logitech mx master 3s",
  "description": "Duplicado a proposito",
  "price": 99.99,
  "stock": 1
}

### Crear con datos invalidos (400 formato)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "price": -10,
  "stock": -1
}

### Reemplazar producto (PUT)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/v1/api/products/{{productId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Notebook Lenovo ThinkPad T14 Gen 5",
  "description": "Intel Core Ultra 7, 32 GB RAM, SSD 1 TB, pantalla 14\" 2.2K",
  "price": 1799.00,
  "stock": 11
}

### Modificar solo el stock (PATCH)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/v1/api/products/{{productId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stock": 25
}

### PATCH sin campos (400)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/v1/api/products/{{productId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Eliminar producto (204) - usar el id de un producto creado
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/v1/api/products/21

### Producto inexistente (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/api/products/99999
